title: "ZT-DSP Protocol Master Guide (docs 1.0.0)"
abstract: >-
  Normative specification of the ZT-DSP communication protocol: a four-phase handshake,
  AEAD transport with per-packet key ratcheting, and traffic-shape defenses. Published as a
  bilingual (Chinese and English) documentation set.
